sentences.text:
Hence in these circumstances and in the interest of justice, the sentence is suspended till the disposal of the appeal subject to the following conditions:-
i) The applicant/accused shall be released on bail on executing a bond for 50,000/-
(Rupees fifty thousand only) with two solvent sureties each for the like sum to the satisfaction of the trial court;
ii) He shall deposit the half of the total fine amount within a period of two months from the date of receipt of a copy of this order;
iii) He shall not commit any offence(s) while on bail;
in and iv) He shall not in any way contact or attempt to contact the victim or her family member(s) in any manner;
Sujith @ Salu vs State Of Kerala on 4 October, 2024

opennyai_summary.decision:
It is submitted by the learned public prosecutor on instructions that the applicant/accused has no criminal antecedents.
The appeal is of the year 2024 and hence there is no possibility of the appeal being taken in the near future.
Hence in these circumstances and in the interest of justice, the sentence is suspended till the disposal of the appeal subject to the following conditions:-
i) The applicant/accused shall be released on bail on executing a bond for 50,000/-
(Rupees fifty thousand only) with two solvent sureties each for the like sum to the satisfaction of the trial court;
ii) He shall deposit the half of the total fine amount within a period of two months from the date of receipt of a copy of this order;
iii) He shall not commit any offence(s) while on bail;
in and iv) He shall not in any way contact or attempt to contact the victim or her family member(s) in any manner;
Sujith @ Salu vs State Of Kerala on 4 October, 2024
v) If the conviction and sentence of the applicant is upheld or even modified, the time during which he is so released shall be excluded in computing the term of his sentence as provided in Section 430(4) BNSS;
vi) It is also made clear that if any of the conditions are violated, the bail shall stand cancelled.
For compliance to 04/12/2024.

